1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:09,943
Rosetta DBT Studio 1.7.2 puts frontier AI models in your editor, on the ChatGPT plan you already pay for.

2
00:00:11,043 --> 00:00:15,843
Add ChatGPT as a provider and sign in with your Plus or Pro account.

3
00:00:16,064 --> 00:00:20,394
Pick a model, from GPT-5.5 to GPT-6.

4
00:00:20,614 --> 00:00:23,067
No API key, and no per-token bill.

5
00:00:24,168 --> 00:00:26,557
The AI assistant now runs on your plan.

6
00:00:26,777 --> 00:00:31,577
Here it reads a failing cell, installs packages, updates the code and reruns it.

7
00:00:32,677 --> 00:00:34,874
Also new: public S3 buckets.

8
00:00:35,094 --> 00:00:40,022
Tick Public bucket, add the name and region, and browse files with no credentials.

9
00:00:41,122 --> 00:00:48,546
Plus, notebook tables you can filter, page and open full screen, and a compact new design for every Settings page.

10
00:00:49,646 --> 00:00:52,803
Rosetta DBT Studio is free and open source.

11
00:00:53,023 --> 00:00:56,992
Download it at rosettadb.io, and star us on GitHub!
